{
  "about": "Batch surface smoke (08 §3.2): open each url with `agent-device open \"<url>\"` on the paired sandbox and check `expect` (a testID, or text). Allowed links open their screen; rejected ones land on Home; an unknown server= shows the toast. ${CHAT_ID}, ${WORKFLOW_ID}, ${RUN_ID}, ${PROJECT_ID}, ${CODEBASE_ID}, ${AUTOMATION_ID}, ${SCRIPT_ID}, ${INTERACTION_ID} come from the seeded sandbox (scripts/mobile/sandbox-pair.mjs). Source: 04-screen-map.md §1.6, MD-145.",
